  dialogueText: '"If you want someone to move toward another location, you can direct
    them away from where you are.

    In Ilokano, ''mapan idiay'' means ''go there.''

    Listen
    carefully: mapan idiay.

    Now, try saying ''mapan idiay'' yourself."

'
